{
  "version": "regressions-v1",
  "description": "Adopted regression scenarios (REGR-1). Each entry began as an operator rejection exported from the console, was anonymized at export, and was adopted here together with the behavior that makes it pass — from then on CI locks that fix. Append-only; never delete a scenario to make the gate green.",
  "scenarios": [
    {
